By combining the desired-term contribution in \eqref{appC1} with the interference contributions from all other users in \eqref{appC2}, the desired gradient expression in \eqref{eq23} is obtained. Furthermore, \eqref{eq24} is obtained using an approach analogous to that employed in deriving \eqref{appC2}. Finally, following a procedure similar to that used for \eqref{XXXX},  $\nabla_{\mathbf{W}_m}
\gamma^{\mathsf r,\mathsf{tot}}$ is obtained as follows:
\begin{equation}
 \nabla_{\mathbf{W}_m}
\gamma^{\mathsf r,\mathsf{tot}}
=
\frac{2}{N\tilde{\sigma}_m^2}
\mathbf{Q}_m^{H}\mathbf{H}_m^{H}
(\mathbf{G}_m^{\mathsf r})^{H}\mathbf{G}_m^{\mathsf r}
\mathbf{H}_m\mathbf{Q}_m\mathbf{W}_m.
\end{equation}
The proof is thus completed.
